# Run outputs. Every path here is written by a run and none of it is tracked:
# results/ and results_gcm/ are the two pipelines' output trees, and .snakemake/
# is Snakemake's own state. The logs/.gitkeep files are tracked so the
# directories survive.
results/
results_gcm/
snake_search/results_search/
.snakemake/
snake/logs/*
!snake/logs/.gitkeep
snake_search/logs/*
!snake_search/logs/.gitkeep
*.log

# Inputs that are not redistributed here. The slide lists define the cohorts and
# are small enough to ship; the patch embeddings, the gene embeddings and the
# MSigDB gene sets are heavy or third-party, and their paths are set in
# snake/config/config.yaml.
/data/*
!/data/slide_sample_list_*.txt
patch_embeddings/

# Local working files, outside the release: report/ is a link to the thesis
# sources, and the two Claude entries are editor configuration.
/report/
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
